    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASTAWAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/baa2e5a1931d0fb4ea966e4fb0607e19.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/baa2e5a1931d0fb4ea966e4fb0607e19.webm?t=1739389801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an <strong>action-packed adventure</strong> in Castaway, diving players into a <strong>pixelated and retro universe</strong>. Assume the role of Martin, whose spaceship crash-landed on an uncharted island where his faithful pet was taken by hostile creatures. <strong>Retrieve your weapons</strong> and venture out to <strong>rescue your kidnapped companion</strong> in this endearing and unexpectedly dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 mini-games in 1! STORY MODE / SURVIVOR MODE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/fb3e32e5cba8d49341cc1a1ad02b985a.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/fb3e32e5cba8d49341cc1a1ad02b985a.apng?t=1739389801\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=92 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the <strong>3 bosses</strong> in the concise and delightful &quot;<strong>Story Mode</strong>&quot; to unlock the thrilling and addictive &quot;<strong>Survivor Mode</strong>.&quot; Ascend a <strong>50-floor tower</strong>, with each level presenting increasingly challenging trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/d166a17efe61c7e10873e5d6e968e318.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/d166a17efe61c7e10873e5d6e968e318.webm?t=1739389801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For All Ages: </strong>From the &quot;pacifist&quot; mode without enemies or \u201cinvincible\u201d to the challenging &quot;unfair&quot; mode, Castaway caters to all ages, from seasoned gamers to younger players discovering the genre for the first time. Try to complete the game as quickly as possible thanks to the <strong>speedrun mode</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a 2D retro pixel art world reminiscent of classic adventure games. It'll feel like coming home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapon Abilities: </strong>Solve puzzles by acquiring weapons with distinct characteristics - the sword for speed, the pickaxe for power, and the grappling hook for increased mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting Soundtrack: </strong>Enjoy chiptune melodies, whether heroic or haunting, paying homage to the 8-bit console era!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASTAWAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/baa2e5a1931d0fb4ea966e4fb0607e19.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/baa2e5a1931d0fb4ea966e4fb0607e19.webm?t=1739389801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an <strong>action-packed adventure</strong> in Castaway, diving players into a <strong>pixelated and retro universe</strong>. Assume the role of Martin, whose spaceship crash-landed on an uncharted island where his faithful pet was taken by hostile creatures. <strong>Retrieve your weapons</strong> and venture out to <strong>rescue your kidnapped companion</strong> in this endearing and unexpectedly dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 mini-games in 1! STORY MODE / SURVIVOR MODE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/fb3e32e5cba8d49341cc1a1ad02b985a.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/fb3e32e5cba8d49341cc1a1ad02b985a.apng?t=1739389801\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=92 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the <strong>3 bosses</strong> in the concise and delightful &quot;<strong>Story Mode</strong>&quot; to unlock the thrilling and addictive &quot;<strong>Survivor Mode</strong>.&quot; Ascend a <strong>50-floor tower</strong>, with each level presenting increasingly challenging trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/d166a17efe61c7e10873e5d6e968e318.poster.avif?t=1739389801\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564860/extras/d166a17efe61c7e10873e5d6e968e318.webm?t=1739389801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For All Ages: </strong>From the &quot;pacifist&quot; mode without enemies or \u201cinvincible\u201d to the challenging &quot;unfair&quot; mode, Castaway caters to all ages, from seasoned gamers to younger players discovering the genre for the first time. Try to complete the game as quickly as possible thanks to the <strong>speedrun mode</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a 2D retro pixel art world reminiscent of classic adventure games. It'll feel like coming home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Weapon Abilities: </strong>Solve puzzles by acquiring weapons with distinct characteristics - the sword for speed, the pickaxe for power, and the grappling hook for increased mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting Soundtrack: </strong>Enjoy chiptune melodies, whether heroic or haunting, paying homage to the 8-bit console era!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Retrieve your weapons, face bosses to save your dog in a retro adventure focused on 3 dungeons. Finish the Story mode to unlock the Survivor mode: a 50-floor &quot;Death Tower&quot;. You'll enjoy classic mechanics, charming visual style, and an enchanting soundtrack.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian",
    "reviews": "\u201cCastaway is brilliantly colorful [...] and offers a taste of adventure that\u2019s just potent enough to make its hour-ish runtime satisfying.\u201d<br>8 \u2013 Destructoid<br><br>\u201cCastaway is one of 2024's most charming games.\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 TechRaptor<br>",
